麵飽飽食魂堂的喜愛，我們特別推出超人氣限定活動！\n\n🔥 消費一碗拉麵即可獲得 1 點\n🔥 集滿 12 點，即可免費兌換「限量拉麵積木乙組」\n🔥 數量有限，送完為止！\n\n除了限量拉麵積木之外，集點還能兌換人氣美食：\n\n🥚 集滿 5 點\n免費兌換溏心蛋乙份\n\n🍗 集滿 10 點\n免費兌換唐揚雞小份（兩塊）乙份\n\n🍜 集滿 15 點\n免費兌換奈良豆皮烏龍麵乙份\n\n每一碗拉麵，都是我們對品質的堅持；\n每一張集點卡，都是我們對顧客的感謝。\n\n趕快帶著親朋好友一起來用餐，\n享受道地日式拉麵的美味，\n集點把專屬拉麵積木帶回家！\n\n📍 麵飽飽食魂堂\n📍 消費一碗拉麵即可獲得 1 點\n📍 集點卡有效期限一年\n📍 限量拉麵積木送完為止\n\n🍥 吃拉麵・集點數・換好禮\n🍥 吃得滿足，集得開心，禮物帶回家！",1]]],[1780319440,1790870399],[1780243200,1790870399,"6月1日 - 10月1日","6月1日 - 10月1日"],null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipM3um19luN4zPUvzjjvBFMG-2KxAtzGQzugIAPV\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipM3um19luN4zPUvzjjvBFMG-2KxAtzGQzugIAPV"]],"2616921585343441681","1759005282484988863",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003dd777865217e22ae8\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003dzh-TW\u0026gl\u003dtw\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003d%E9%BA%B5%E9%A3%BD%E9%A3%BD%E9%A3%9F%E9%AD%82%E5%A0%82\u0026ludocid\u003d14299274618344644746\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEOrwp4Cd1Mq1CQ\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEOrwp4Cd1Mq1CQ,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F1759005282484988863%2FlocalPosts%2F2616921585343441681/version/1780319481579000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCJHWytuRisuoJBIWQ0lITTBvZ0tFT3J3cDRDZDFNcTFDURoTQ2d3SS1vbjIwQVlReU1MRHNBRQ\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003d%E9%BA%B5%E9%A3%BD%E9%A3%BD%E9%A3%9F%E9%AD%82%E5%A0%82\u0026ludocid\u003d14299274618344644746\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEOrwp4Cd1Mq1CQ\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5VseSgw7WUA3pp7hM46pYmC","0ahUKEwidyO-QxtKWAxXVaPUHHerjDUQQ544CCLgCKDs",null,"2026年6月1日",null,null,2,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u1759005282484988863/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChMyNjE2OTIxNTg1MzQzNDQxNjgx","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u1759005282484988863/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChMyNjE2OTIxNTg1MzQzNDQxNjgx",null,null,null,null,null,["2616921585343441681","CIHM0ogKEOrwp4Cd1Mq1CQ","CgwI-on20AYQyMLDsAE"]],[null,[[["🍜 一碗拉麵，一段跨越國界的感動 🇯🇵❤️🇹🇼\n\n今天特別感謝來自日本的旅客，\n因朋友介紹，特地來到這裡品嚐我的拉麵。\n\n最讓我感動的是——\n他吃完後笑著說：\n「這碗拉麵，不會輸給日本的知名連鎖店。」\n\n這不只是稱讚，\n更是一份對料理的肯定，\n也是我一直堅持用心熬湯、用心做麵的原因。\n\n每一碗端出去的拉麵，\n不只是食物，\n而是一份溫度、一份誠意、一份故事。\n\n如果你也正在尋找一碗\n能讓人記住的拉麵，\n歡迎來試試看。\n\n也許下一個被感動的人，就是你。🍥\n\n",1],["#用一碗拉麵說故事",3,null,"用一碗拉麵說故事"],["\n",1],["#職人精神",3,null,"職人精神"],["\n",1],["#值得你親自來",3,null,"值得你親自來"],[":::",1]]],[1774688848,1790500048],null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipM2Jv6-EscYPk4_FSe59GHiAH-128dSM-2hNSHZ\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipM2Jv6-EscYPk4_FSe59GHiAH-128dSM-2hNSHZ"]],"6093654915318576794","1759005282484988863",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003dd777865217e22ae8\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003dzh-TW\u0026gl\u003dtw\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003d%E9%BA%B5%E9%A3%BD%E9%A3%BD%E9%A3%9F%E9%AD%82%E5%A0%82\u0026ludocid\u003d14299274618344644746\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEIbg6sqf5b31Wg\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEIbg6sqf5b31Wg,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F1759005282484988863%2FlocalPosts%2F6093654915318576794/version/1774688848101000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCJrtgZvC28DIVBIWQ0lITTBvZ0tFSWJnNnNxZjViMzFXZxoTQ2d3STBMU2V6Z1lReU9hRDZ3RQ\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003d%E9%BA%B5%E9%A3%BD%E9%A3%BD%E9%A3%9F%E9%AD%82%E5%A0%82\u0026ludocid\u003d14299274618344644746\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEIbg6sqf5b31Wg\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5VseSgw7WUA3pp7hM46pYmC","0ahUKEwidyO-QxtKWAxXVaPUHHerjDUQQ544CCLkCKDw",null,"2026年3月28日",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u1759005282484988863/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM2MDkzNjU0OTE1MzE4NTc2Nzk0","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u1759005282484988863/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM2MDkzNjU0OTE1MzE4NTc2Nzk0",null,null,null,null,null,["60936549153185767